===Etymology 1===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰeyd-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|bitte}}, {{m|enm|bite}}, from {{inh|en|ang|bita|t=bit; fragment; morsel}} and {{m|ang|bite|t=a bite; cut}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*bitô}} and {{m|gem-pro|*bitiz}}; both from {{der|en|ine-pro|*bʰeyd-|t=to split}}. More at {{l|en|bite}}.

